Origin
------
iCommander is a native macOS reimplementation of the behavior of Tandem
Commander (https://github.com/tandemcommander/tandemcommander), which derives
from Open Salamander (https://github.com/OpenSalamander/salamander), both
licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2 or (at your option)
any later version. The keyboard layout, commands, dialogs and behavior follow
those programs and their user manual; parts of the design were studied in
their source code. No source files were copied. Because Tandem Commander and
Open Salamander permit "any later version", this work is distributed under
GPL-3.0-or-later.

"Salamander", "Open Salamander" and "Tandem Commander" are names of those
projects; iCommander is not affiliated with or endorsed by their authors.

